      {
       "text": "This task is to update the main fcrepo4 pom.xml to specify support for \"source\" of 1.8, while keeping \"target\" as 1.7.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Additionally, fcrepo-camel and fcrepo-build-tools /pom.xml should be updated.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
