       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>When I update the \"source\" to 1.8 and leave the \"target\" as 1.7, I get the Maven error:<br/>\n\"\"javacTask: source release 1.8 requires target release 1.8\"\"</p>\n\n<p>However, changing both \"source\" and \"target\" to 1.8 results in a successful build.</p>",
     "created": "15/Jan/15 5:25 PM",
     "id": "12793",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/11203/comment/12793",
     "updateAuthor": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
