      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This is unfortunate. We may want to try a few different javacs, just in the interest of fully understanding the problem, but if you've found even one that relies on the command-line switch instead of actually examining the code, then we will just have to leave it as is until April.</p>",
